## 6. PROFILE EXTRACTION - ALL FIELDS

❌ **BAD:** Document only 7 mapped fields from a 49-field profile

✅ **GOOD:**
```markdown
**Total Fields:** 49 | **Mapped:** 7 | **Unmapped:** 42

| Key | Name | Path | Type | Mapped | Target |
|-----|------|------|------|--------|--------|
| 5 | name | Root/.../name | character | ❌ | - |
| 6 | priceListKey | Root/.../priceListKey | character | ✅ | UDF_Pricebook2id |
```

**Why:** Unmapped fields are available for future use; must be documented.

---

## 7. CONNECTOR/OPERATION EXTRACTION

❌ **BAD:** `Solace connector with queue`

✅ **GOOD:**
```markdown
| Setting | Value |
|---------|-------|
| **Mode** | PERSISTENT_TRANSACTED |
| **Batch Size** | 1 |
| **Receive Timeout** | 10000 ms |
| **Max Concurrent Executions** | 1 |
| **Destination/Queue** | HNK/COMMERCE/FINALPRICE/ES/SALESFORCE |
```

**Why:** Includes mode, batch settings, timeouts — all operational details.

