## 10. VALUE TYPES REFERENCE

| Type | XML Element | Extract |
|------|-------------|---------|
| static | `<staticparameter staticproperty="{val}"/>` | Literal value |
| crossref | `<crossrefparameter crossRefTableId="{id}" outputParamName="{col}">` | Table ID, column, ALL inputs |
| profile | `<profileparameter elementId="{id}" profileId="{uuid}"/>` | Element name AND path |
| execution | `<executionparameter executionproperty="{prop}"/>` | Property name |
| track | `<trackparameter propertyId="{path}" defaultValue="{val}"/>` | Path AND default value |
| process | `<processparameter processproperty="{name}"/>` | Property name |

---

## 11. COMMON MISTAKES

| Mistake | Correct Approach |
|---------|------------------|
| Using Python/Bash for extraction | Use Read tool directly |
| Generating table without INVENTORY step | Count elements first, COMMIT to N (RGV §1) |
| Proceeding without VERIFY step | Count generated rows, compare to N (RGV §1) |
| Summarized/abbreviated mapping tables | Document ALL mappings, every row |
| Assuming identical source/target paths | Verify each mapping individually |
| Missing `position` attribute | Extract for execution order |
| Missing `cacheEnabled` | Extract for each function step |
| Only mapped profile fields | Document ALL fields |
| "0 rows" for cross-ref | Extract actual data if present |
| Summarizing script code | Include COMPLETE code |
| Generic action descriptions | List ALL properties with values |
| Verification counts in main doc | Counts go ONLY in verification-checklist.md |
| Generating profiles/functions in Phase 2 | Profiles/functions → Phase 3, connectors → Phase 4 |

